: pfd variable ;  10 lit alloc pfd !  0 lit pfd @ !  1 lit pfd @ 4 lit + !
0 lit icnt !  0 lit unl !  0 lit tried !  0 lit have !  0 lit wonline !  0 lit wmtried !  0 lit mnfd !  FFFFFFFF lit wfd !  obuf @ opos !
\ a line when one comes; the node every 4 s while none does; once the
\ wallet is open, the message layer's socket too, and its turn each
\ second
begin
	have @ wmtried @ 0= and nodeok @ and if wmstart then
	0 lit pfd @ !  1 lit pfd @ 4 lit + !  mnfd @ pfd @ 8 lit + !  1 lit pfd @ C lit + !
	pfd @  wonline @ if 2 lit 3B9ACA00 lit else 1 lit EE6B2800 lit then  poll drop
	pfd @ 4 lit + @ 10 lit rshift if
		0 lit ibuf @ icnt @ + 3FFF lit icnt @ - read  dup 0 lit > if icnt @ + icnt !  lines  1 lit else drop 0 lit then
	else 1 lit then
	wonline @ if
		wmrun
		mnms wmlast @ - FA0 lit u< 0= if mnms wmlast !  wtick then
	else
		pfd @ 4 lit + @ 10 lit rshift 0= if wtick then
	then
while repeat
bye
